{"articleNo":"67433","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=67433&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년도 제6기 한국대학생 지식봉사(교육기부)사업 멘토 모집 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.10.10","hit":"7952","attachments":[{"name":"제6기 한국대학생 지식봉사 신청서 작성.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=67433&attachNo=2236"},{"name":"지식봉사 FAQ.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=67433&attachNo=2275"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">『2012년도 제6기 한국대학생 지식봉사(교육기부) 사업』</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">멘토 모집 공고</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"가. 제목\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"가. 제목\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">대학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">초,중,고교 및 지역아동센터 학생들</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">을 대상으로 학습지도 및 학습동기부여 등의 지식봉사 활동을 진행하고, 재단은 참여대학생이 미래 인재로 양성될 수 있도록 지원하는 인재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">육성지원 프로그램 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">한국 대학생 지식봉사 멘토링</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; text-shadow: auto\">에 열의가 있는 대학생 멘토 여러분의 많은 참여 부탁드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012년 10월 5일</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">한국장학재단 이사장</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 사업 소개</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; text-shadow: auto; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">재단과 한국대학생 지식봉사 참여 대학의 학생들이 학기 중에 초,중,고교 및 지역아동센터 학생들을 대상으로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학습지도 및 진로상담 등의 봉사활동을 진행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">하고, 재단은 참여 대학생이 미래 성공인재로 양성될 수 있도록 지원하는 인재육성지원 사업</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 20.74pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">항 목</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 20.74pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">내 용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 84.79pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">멘 토</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(봉사자)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 84.79pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 대학 재학생(대학원생,휴학생 참여 가능,별도 성적기준 없음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">사회봉사과목 수강생 봉사자 또는 지역 교육청,지자체,지역아동센터</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 봉사프로그램 참여자 등 정부인증 사회봉사기관 봉사자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 위 사항에 모두 포함되는 학생</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 98.32pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">멘 티</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(수혜자)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 98.32pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 전국 초,중학교 및 고등학교 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지역아동센터 등 정부인증 사회봉사기관에서 참여하는 초중고교생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 멘티는 멘티 기관 담당 선생님이 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">정부인증 사회봉사기관 여부는 보건복지부(www.vms.or.kr), 행정안전부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(www.1365.go.kr) 홈페이지 등을 통해 확인</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 87.68pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">구 성</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 87.68pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 멘토(봉사자) 1인당 멘티(수혜자) 5명 이내로 그룹 구성</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 6기 지식봉사에서는 재단에서 별도로 멘토-멘티 매칭하지 않음. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">대학 담당부서 또는 봉사활동 인증포털을 통해 멘티 기관 확인.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 72.67pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">운영기간</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 72.67pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 2012.10월~2012.12월</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 운영 기간은 멘토와 멘티(학교) 간 합의에 따라 조정 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 165%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 증빙서류 제출 시, 9월 이후 활동한 봉사시간 인정</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 96.48pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 52.94pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">봉사시간</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 356.84pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 52.94pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 30시간 기준(최소 6시간 이상)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 기준 시간(6시간) 미만일 경우, 지원금 지급 및 봉사