char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 학습지도(예체능 과목 지도 포함),상담,토론 등의 멘토링</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 175%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"○\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 특별활동(영화관람·박물관견학 등 체험학습) 포함</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 474.34pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 신청 대상</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">* 대학 재학생(대학원생,휴학생 참여 가능, 별도 성적기준 없음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">* 현재 봉사프로그램 참여자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 지역 교육청,지자체,지역아동센터 봉사프로그램 참여자 등 정부인증 사회봉사기관 봉사자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 단, 봉사 대상이 초,중,고등학교 학생으로서 교육과 관련된 봉사일 경우에 한하며,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕\">정부인증기관 여부는 보건복지부(www.vms.or.kr), 행정안전부(www.1365.go.kr) 등 참조 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- <font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">봉사프로그램 참여예정자 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">봉사기관(초,중,고등학교 및 지역 아동센터)과 연락해서</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"선그리기\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;멘티와 매칭을</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 한 후 학생처에 신청</span></fon